      "Description": "Grid Configuration - Adjust these values",
      "Code": "{\n  // CONFIGURE THESE SETTINGS\n  startX = 1.0,      // Starting X position on sheet (feet)\n  startY = 8.0,      // Starting Y position on sheet (feet)  \n  spacingX = 2.8,    // Horizontal spacing between viewports (feet)\n  spacingY = 3.8,    // Vertical spacing between viewports (feet)\n  maxCols = 2        // Maximum sections per row\n};",
      "X": 350.0,
      "Y": 300.0,
